  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nFree shipping on orders $150+\n\nShop\nMagazine\nAbout\nCart\nSpring collection ’22\n\nShop vibrant knitwear to beat the winter blues\n\nInspired by the burst of life spring brings, we've designed this collection with bright splashes of color.\nShop spring lookbook \nGoodbye, boring. Shop by your favorite color & instantly brighten up your closet.\nMulticolor \nMostly red \nMostly blue \nMostly yellow \nFor all genders\n\nMADE FOR EVERYONE\n\nOur products are made for anyone to wear. They have a relaxed fit that's comfy and flattering.\n\n100% premium wool\n\nUNCOMPROMISING QUALITY\n\nOur products are made from the highest quality fibers. It's what you expect, so it's what we expect.\n\nMade in England\n\nHERITAGE GOODS\n\nThe process of creating our products is steeped in tradition. From the design influence right through to the manufacturing process.\n\nWe love them, you love them.\nShop our bestsellers \nPocket Cardi\nRegular price\n$245.00 CAD\nTri-Stripe Lambswool Crew\nRegular price\n$155.00 CAD\nKnitted Chore Jacket\nRegular price\n$230.00 CAD\nLambswool Cardigan\nRegular price\n$215.00 CAD\nEst. 2014\nWe’re a modern, socially-conscious knitwear brand inspired by quality craftsmanship, natural fibers & the power of human connection.\nEverything we make is crafted with care at our purpose-built factory in Wigston, Leicestershire.\nThanks to a relentless pursuit of fun fashion we've established ourselves as the store you go to when gray is not an option.\nLearn more about us \nStay in the know\nEmail\n\nFollow us on social media\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nInstagram\nTikTok\nYouTube\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Country of Origin. © 2026 Powered by Shopify"
